# The .eval logs ARE the data and are committed deliberately.
#
# They used to be excluded here. All of results/ is a couple of MB, so there was
# never a size reason — and excluding them meant publishing the code and the
# notebooks while silently omitting every measurement behind them. Shipping the
# raw transcripts is also what lets `inspect score --model <judge>` add an
# external judge to these runs later without regenerating a single trial, which
# is the study's largest stated limitation.
#
# If results/ ever gets genuinely large, add an explicit size cap here rather
# than a blanket exclusion, so the omission is a decision rather than a default.

# Environment — .venv is a symlink to ../pleasing/.venv, never commit it.
.venv
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Local secrets. Note the LiteLLM/Postgres credentials live in ../.env, which is
# outside this repo root — keep it that way.
.jupyter-token
jupyter.log
.env
